    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Campus Cafe Sales Analysis\"\n---\n\n\n## Analysis of the Sales of the Campus Cafe\n@tbl-cafe-data summarizes the cups sold and price of each drink sold at the Campus Cafe. The total cups sold is 130\n\n::: {#tbl-cafe-data .cell tbl-cap='Cups sold and price by drink' execution_count=2}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}\n```{=html}\n<div>\n<style scoped>\n    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe thead th {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n</style>\n<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n      <th></th>\n      <th>drink</th>\n      <th>cups</th>\n      <th>price</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>0</th>\n      <td>Coffee</td>\n      <td>45</td>\n      <td>3.0</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>1</th>\n      <td>Tea</td>\n      <td>30</td>\n      <td>2.5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>2</th>\n      <td>Latte</td>\n      <td>35</td>\n      <td>4.5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>3</th>\n      <td>Hot Chocolate</td>\n      <td>20</td>\n      <td>4.0</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n",
